    "media_with_text_JWdVtJ": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_wwMiPm": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How the GLO Wearable Breast Pump Fits Your Lifestyle",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_Fg9qEW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The Ameda GLO Wearable Breast Pump is made for busy moms who need flexibility and confidence throughout their pumping journey. This hands-free breast pump fits discreetly under clothing, so you can pump at work, in the car, or while running errands without missing a beat. The wearable breast design allows you to move freely and stay productive during each typical pumping session.</p><p>With its super quiet operation, comfortable collection cup, and adjustable intensity settings, you can maintain your milk supply anywhere, whether you’re traveling, working in an office, or relaxing at home. Compact and portable, it’s one of the best wearable breast pumps for modern moms who want strong breast pump suction power.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_wwMiPm",
        "text_Fg9qEW"
      ],
      "disabled": true,
