    "media_with_text_PHaPtY": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_binTMp": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Navigating Insurance & Eligibility for Wearable Breast Pumps",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_RwCYUq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Many moms qualify for an electric breast pump or wearable pump through their insurance provider, making the process of choosing the right pump easier and more affordable. At Ameda, we help you confirm eligibility and guide you through your coverage so you can access one of the best wearable breast pumps available. Our team works closely with lactation experts and certified partners to ensure every mom has access to a high-quality hospital-grade pump that supports her needs. If you’re unsure where to start, reach out to your insurance provider or contact Ameda for assistance in finding wearable breast pumps included in your plan.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "button_DYBCjG": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "Free Pumps Through Insurance",
            "button_link": "shopify://pages/insurance",
            "button_style": "btn btn--secondary"
          }
