    "custom_liquid_BWYHhM": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How does the GLO Wearable Breast Pump work?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The GLO Wearable Breast Pump is an electric breast pump that uses hospital-grade suction power to express milk efficiently and comfortably. Simply place the collection cups inside your bra, ensuring a secure fit against your breast, and adjust the flange size for comfort. With soft pump parts and stimulation mode that mimics natural let-down, the GLO makes each pumping session smooth and effective. The super-quiet motor keeps you comfortable and discreet while expressing breast milk anywhere you need.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I use the GLO pump for double pumping?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. The Ameda GLO Wearable Breast Pump allows both single and double pumping, so you can express the most milk in less time. Many moms use it as their primary pump for daily sessions, while others pair it with other pumps or a manual pump for flexibility. The ability to double pump makes it ideal for maintaining consistent milk flow and ensuring both breasts are fully emptied during a typical pumping session.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How many suction levels are available, and how do I customize them?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The GLO wearable pump features 15 suction levels across four intensity settings: Stimulation Mode, Expression Mode, Massage Mode, and Auto Mode. You can easily fine-tune the suction strength to find your perfect comfort level and maximize milk output. Lactation experts and certified lactation counselors recommend adjusting suction levels to mimic your baby’s rhythm for optimal results.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Are different flange sizes available?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. Every GLO breast pump includes 24 mm flanges and soft inserts in 17 mm, 19 mm, and 21 mm flange sizes to accommodate your nipple size and comfort preferences. Finding the correct fit is an important consideration for comfort and efficient milk expression. You can also purchase additional flange sizes separately to customize your pumping experience.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How long does the battery last, and how do I recharge it?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The Ameda GLO Wearable Breast Pump offers excellent battery life, providing up to 100 minutes of use on a full charge. Recharging is simple; just connect the included USB cable between sessions. Its reliable electric battery system ensures consistent performance throughout your pumping sessions, giving moms freedom to pump hands-free wherever their day takes them.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is the GLO pump discreet for use in public places?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. The Ameda GLO Wearable Breast Pump was designed as a discreet pump for modern moms. Its incredibly lightweight, low-profile design sits comfortably under clothing, making it easy to pump hands-free without drawing attention. The super quiet motor allows you to continue daily activities, take calls, or move freely throughout a typical pumping session. For moms looking for the best wearable breast pump that fits seamlessly into daily life, GLO provides an elegant, quiet, and efficient solution.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How do I clean and store my GLO Wearable Breast Pump?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"All pump parts that come into contact with breast milk are dishwasher safe, making cleanup quick and simple. You can also hand-wash the collection cups, valves, and flanges in warm, soapy water. After each pumping session, make sure to thoroughly dry all components before storing them in a clean container or storage bags. Keeping your pump parts clean helps maintain strong suction, reduces the chance of less milk output, and extends the life of your wearable pump.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>",
        "section_height": "tight",
        "full_width": false,
        "dividers": "none",
        "color_scheme": "none",
        "baby_patterns": false,
        "prevent_animation": false
      }
