            "text": "<p>The Ameda GLO Wearable Breast Pump offers excellent battery life, providing up to 100 minutes of use on a full charge. Recharging is simple; just connect the included USB cable between sessions. Its reliable electric battery system ensures consistent performance throughout your pumping sessions, giving moms freedom to pump hands-free wherever their day takes them.</p>"
