            "heading": "How do I clean and store my GLO Wearable Breast Pump?",
            "text": "<p>All pump parts that come into contact with breast milk are dishwasher safe, making cleanup quick and simple. You can also hand-wash the collection cups, valves, and flanges in warm, soapy water. After each pumping session, make sure to thoroughly dry all components before storing them in a clean container or storage bags. Keeping your pump parts clean helps maintain strong suction, reduces the chance of less milk output, and extends the life of your wearable pump.</p>"
